description: Skip contrib/ symlinks and large vendored assets unless user asks
alwaysApply: true
---

# contrib/ off-limits

`contrib/` = symlinks to external repos. Many files exceed 50MB (notebooks, catalogues).

- Do not read, search, grep, or @-mention paths under `contrib/`
- Do not open notebooks or CSV/XLSX there
- If contrib code needed: ask user for specific small file or work in sibling repo directly

MontuPython refactor scope = `montu/`, `montu-app/`, root config/docs — not vendored deps in `contrib/`.
